{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06999","headline":"晚出伊阙寄河南裴中丞 · 陶翰","name":"晚出伊阙寄河南裴中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退无偃息资，进无当代策。\n冉冉时将暮，坐爲周南客。\n前登阙塞门，永眺伊城陌。\n长川黯已空，千里寒气白。\n家本渭水西，异日同所适。\n秉志师禽尚，微言祖庄易。\n一辞林壑间，共系风尘役。\n交朋忽先进，天道何纷剧。\n岂念嘉遯时，依依偶沮溺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}